{% comment %}
  B2B dropshipping landing page (templates/page.dropshipment.json). A light, "product"
  style page, deliberately unlike the showroom and company pages:

  - Hero: headline + an animated mock of the partner's store (a product card, a "new
    order" notification and a delivery tracker going paid -> packed -> delivered).
  - Proof row (the product count is live), the flow as a delivery route, a comparison
    table (classic store vs dropshipping with us), a margin calculator
    (assets/alc-b2b.js), a moving strip of real products, FAQ (+ FAQPage data) and a
    WhatsApp call to action for the B2B team.

  Every storefront language has a built-in translation. Styles: assets/alc-b2b.css.
{% endcomment %}
{{ 'alc-b2b.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'alc-b2b.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

